{
 "spec": "and was committed before this script was run; it is\nrepeated here only so the code and the record cannot drift:\n\n    p_srv = p12 + d_N   on the rows v17 serves, p12 elsewhere\n            (arm `N`, ridge, serve.FIT_FOLDS leave-one-out, the handshake blocks -- the\n             same construction \u00a77aa used for `d_new`)\n    d     = m - p_srv,   r = y - p_srv\n    a(f)  = sum(r d) / sum(d d)  over the TWO OTHER folds pooled, never over f\n    gain  = mean(2 a r d - a^2 d^2)  on f, s^2 per row, day-clustered at BOOT/SEED\n    gate  = every fold interval clear above zero, else MAYBE (strict: `a` is fold-selected)\n\n`p_srv` carries THIS LANE's part of v17 and not `exp-046-surfacefit`'s with-clock\ncorrection, which has no fold-side vector on disk.  So every arm is priced twice, over\n`p_srv` and over bare `p12` (the pre-surface head the old numbers used), and the difference\nbetween the two columns is what the desk asked for.",
